WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.407
Let’s summarize the cleaning workflow.

00:00:02.407 --> 00:00:06.117
Count missing values before deciding what to do.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:09.572
Check duplicates before calculating totals.

00:00:09.572 --> 00:00:14.902
Verify data types. Standardize categories before grouping.

00:00:14.902 --> 00:00:19.397
Flag unusual values instead of automatically deleting them.

00:00:19.397 --> 00:00:24.446
Use EDA to understand the data before formal analysis or modeling.

00:00:25.115 --> 00:00:29.034
Good analysis starts with knowing what is actually in the dataset.

00:00:29.586 --> 00:00:36.148
In Module 13, we’ll take the cleaned data and focus on evidence and communication.

00:00:36.148 --> 00:00:42.418
You’ll calculate descriptive statistics, examine distributions, compare groups, look at relationships,

00:00:42.418 --> 00:00:49.827
discuss uncertainty, and choose visual forms that help explain the findings clearly.
